Explanation: copied from CannObserv/processor, processor#6).
Explanation: nodejs comes from NodeSource, never universe's 18. Pinned by host because the
Explanation: repo's Release Origin is aptly's generic ". nodistro". 600: above 500, below 1000.
Package: nodejs
Pin: origin deb.nodesource.com
Pin-Priority: 600

Explanation: Everything else this host serves (nsolid, and whatever it adds) stays below
